{"unit_id":"pengyue-polaron__deepseek-harness-genui#card-zh","repo":"pengyue-polaron/deepseek-harness-genui","commit":"d24d91e3b6462aae498fa8452abcb44e3c53e9d5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness GenUI（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为当前任务生成可交互的 React + TypeScript 应用，让用户通过界面探索信息、完成选择并把结果交给下一轮 Agent。它注册生成、更新、检查和状态读取等工具，在对话中嵌入应用，也支持 Canvas、全屏和本地链接。主要能力包括代码构建与诊断、保存任务状态、按声明授权调用工具或公开接口，以及复用设计配置。适合需要可视化操作或多步选择的 Harness Web 任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:321-439"]}
{"unit_id":"pengyue-polaron__deepseek-harness-genui#card-en","repo":"pengyue-polaron/deepseek-harness-genui","commit":"d24d91e3b6462aae498fa8452abcb44e3c53e9d5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Harness GenUI (DSH Web plugin) creates interactive React apps and carries user choices into later Agent turns. Its tools create, update, inspect, and read apps, shown inline or in Canvas. It compiles source, reports diagnostics, and supports reusable designs and declared tool access.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:321-439"]}
